{
  "about": "Several text boxes formatted at once (TextSelection) on both phones: the boxes as a design writes them, what each readout reads for a selection of them (null for Mixed), and which boxes a change of each property reaches. A property is a box's when it is a text box's, or for spacing and a list a shape's with words in it (an effect and a curve never are), transparency anything's; a change reaches the unlocked ones that have it, and a readout reads them too, or all that have it when every one is locked. Boxes read alike when they read alike as shown: letter spacing in whole percent of each box's own type size (a shape's words' size when it has none), line height to a hundredth, paragraph spacing to a tenth of an em, the curve in whole degrees, opacity in whole percent, an effect's settings in whole numbers. A box with no lineHeight reads 1.25, no paragraphSpacing 0, no curve 0.",
